WEBVTT

00:00.650 --> 00:03.894
How it works. A skill for Claude Code.

00:05.000 --> 00:07.677
Name a mechanism, or an idea.

00:08.850 --> 00:14.205
It draws the real machine, cut open, as a live engineering drawing.

00:17.500 --> 00:21.499
Then a 3D cutaway you can turn, and take apart.

00:25.200 --> 00:28.730
21 sheets. 508 parts.

00:28.750 --> 00:30.883
And each one tells you what it does.

00:32.600 --> 00:39.002
Made for engineering students, for teachers who want lectures to be visual, and for the curious.

00:40.050 --> 00:43.729
And for developers: a rate limiter is a cistern.

00:45.050 --> 00:48.363
Install it with one line. Then just ask.

00:51.900 --> 00:54.366
The cut is the explanation.

01:00.700 --> 01:05.753
Inspired by Anatomy, the Claude Code skill by @wheresryan22.
